---
title: Changelog
description: Notable changes to the design system.
order: 6
---

## Phase 2

- CLI/registry distribution: `registry.json` and per-item `/r/<name>.json`, built via `bun run registry:build` from the same `_registry.svx` frontmatter used everywhere else.
- `/registry` overview page, and a live "CLI" install tab on every item page.
- `⌘K`/`Ctrl K` search across docs and registry items, powered by Orama.
- `llms.txt`/`llms-full.txt` and a raw-Markdown `.md` twin of every content page.
- Amber and Violet accent color presets, alongside the existing light/dark toggle.

## Phase 1

- Doc-shell built on shadcn-svelte's `sidebar-07` block.
- Docs, Components, Blocks, and Utilities sections, backed by a file-based registry catalog.
- Live component previews, syntax-highlighted source, and manual install instructions on every item page.
- Light/dark theming with a no-flash toggle.
- Storybook stories colocated with each registry item.
